WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.835
[ Knock on door ]
-Come in.

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:04.303
-Hi, Lin.
-Oh, hey, Jimmy.

00:00:04.303 --> 00:00:05.705
I'm so excited to be
on the show tonight.

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:07.439
Isn't this great?
-Yeah, it is great.

00:00:07.439 --> 00:00:10.276
It's, uh...
It's great.

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:12.679
-You okay, bud?
You seem pretty down.

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:14.680
-Well, just I was walking
to work today.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:15.714
I walked through
the theater district,

00:00:15.714 --> 00:00:17.750
and just made me miss Broadway.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.619
-Jimmy, didn't you hear?

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:21.053
Broadway's coming back.

00:00:21.053 --> 00:00:22.255
-Broadway's coming back?

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:24.056
-Yeah, Broadway's coming back
in September!

00:00:24.056 --> 00:00:25.692
-This is so amazing.

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:28.094
Man, I miss going to see a play.

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:29.562
-And I miss playing.

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:32.531
[ Dramatic music plays ]

00:00:32.531 --> 00:00:35.268
♪ Broadway, oh, Broadway ♪

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:37.704
♪ You're finally coming back ♪

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:40.673
♪ I miss drinking wine
out of sippy cups ♪

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:43.375
♪ And a $20 snack ♪

00:00:43.375 --> 00:00:46.045
♪ A night at the theater ♪

00:00:46.045 --> 00:00:48.581
♪ My favorite kind of date ♪

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:54.586
♪ I even miss the people
who always show up late ♪

00:00:54.586 --> 00:00:56.489
-Hi. I'm sorry.
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:59.092
Is this row H?
No, I'm in I.

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:00.593
-♪ I miss Henry's wives
in "Six" ♪

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:01.727
-♪ Ex-wives ♪

00:01:01.727 --> 00:01:03.696
-♪ Think of
all of that alimony ♪

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:05.465
♪ I miss that brooding phantom ♪

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:07.766
-♪ The only masked singer
with a Tony ♪

00:01:07.766 --> 00:01:10.035
♪ I miss the ladies
of "Chicago" ♪

00:01:10.035 --> 00:01:12.405
-♪ Can these legs
kick even higher? ♪

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:14.407
-♪ I miss that anxious
Evan Hansen ♪

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:16.442
-♪ Yes, I'm cute
but I'm a liar ♪

00:01:16.442 --> 00:01:18.978
-♪ I miss going down
to Hadestown ♪

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:20.913
♪ For true love I'll go far ♪

00:01:20.913 --> 00:01:23.149
-♪ I want to yell,
"Don't turn around" ♪

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:25.251
♪ To the guy with the guitar ♪

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:27.653
♪ On the West Side
there's a story ♪

00:01:27.653 --> 00:01:29.722
♪ About the Jets and Sharks ♪

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:31.624
-♪ Where fighting
is just dancing ♪

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:34.127
-♪ And the lions
hit their marks ♪

00:01:34.127 --> 00:01:36.229
-♪ It's been a year
of quarantine ♪

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:38.531
♪ It's time for company ♪
-Bobby, Bobby.

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:41.734
-♪ "Come From Away" taught me
all about hospitality ♪

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:42.835
-Sorry. Sorry.

00:01:42.835 --> 00:01:45.171
♪ I miss Mormons
telling me hello ♪

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:47.373
-♪ Founding fathers dueling,
whoa ♪

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:51.344
♪ And dancers cancan-canning
through Paris ♪

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:53.712
-♪ I miss trying out
for "A Chorus Line" ♪

00:01:53.712 --> 00:01:55.948
-♪ A whole new world
would be divine ♪

00:01:55.948 --> 00:02:00.486
-♪ And feeling like
I'm defying gravity ♪

00:02:00.486 --> 00:02:02.254
Sorry, I gained a few pounds
during quarantine.

00:02:02.254 --> 00:02:04.757
-It's okay, Jimmy.
Keep going.

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:08.428
♪ But most of all,
I miss the crowds ♪

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:11.830
♪ The theater is packed,
they're cheering so loud ♪

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:13.766
♪ I just hope
we make it through ♪

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:15.835
-But, Lin, we have
a full audience now!

00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:18.538
-♪ We do? ♪
-Yeah, man, we do.

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:28.147
-♪ We do ♪

00:02:28.147 --> 00:02:30.283
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:30.283 --> 00:02:35.388
♪♪

00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:40.493
♪♪

00:02:40.493 --> 00:02:42.595
-♪ You say ♪

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:44.297
♪ It's been a full year ♪

00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:47.967
♪ Since you've seen a live show
or a play ♪

00:02:47.967 --> 00:02:50.302
-♪ You cry ♪

00:02:50.302 --> 00:02:55.541
♪ In the terrible sourdough
starter you made to get by ♪

00:02:55.541 --> 00:02:58.611
-♪ We've gone mad ♪

00:02:58.611 --> 00:03:01.213
-♪ Remember we've been
in containment ♪

00:03:01.213 --> 00:03:03.049
♪ For hundreds of days ♪

00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:06.051
-♪ But it's not all bad ♪

00:03:06.051 --> 00:03:09.488
-♪ In September,
for your entertainment ♪

00:03:09.488 --> 00:03:11.057
♪ Broadway's back ♪

00:03:11.057 --> 00:03:13.326
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:21.233 --> 00:03:23.369
-♪ And you'll be back ♪

00:03:23.369 --> 00:03:25.571
♪ Soon you'll see ♪

00:03:25.571 --> 00:03:29.575
♪ You'll remember
what it's like to be ♪

00:03:29.575 --> 00:03:33.412
-♪ In Times Square for a show ♪

00:03:33.412 --> 00:03:37.349
